{"id":"n-20261030-5u8f0v","category":"sports","display_title":"Milan Faces Inter in Derby","display_title_he":"מילאן פוגשת את אינטר בדרבי","short_summary":"Milan prepares to face league leaders Inter in a high-stakes Serie A derby, while third-place Roma travels to play Udinese.","english_level":"C1","words":468,"reading_time":3,"image":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/PSV-Inter_Milan_0-1_%282108530233%29.jpg/960px-PSV-Inter_Milan_0-1_%282108530233%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"FaceMePLS from The Hague, The Netherlands · CC BY 2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:PSV-Inter_Milan_0-1_(2108530233).jpg"},"sources":[{"name":"Walla","domain":"sports.walla.co.il","url":"https://sports.walla.co.il/item/3874223","title":"דרבי חם בסן סירו: הרצף העירוני של מילאן יימשך?","published_at":"2026-10-30T09:30:00.000Z"}],"published_at":"2026-10-30T09:30:00.000Z","first_published_in_app_at":"2026-10-30T07:50:17.823Z","quality_score":9,"interest_score":8,"verification_status":"verified","content_status":"published","paragraphs":["The tenth round of the Italian Serie A promises an electrifying weekend, anchored by the iconic Milanese derby at the San Siro. League leaders Inter head into the fixture holding a commanding seven-point advantage over their arch-rivals, Milan, who currently occupy the fifth position in the standings. Midweek matches shaped this landscape, and the upcoming clash carries immense weight for both clubs. Milan approaches the encounter after suffering their maiden league defeat of the season, a stinging four-to-two home loss against Bologna. Compounding the challenge, this marks the first official derby appearance for their manager since that setback. Historical context, however, provides a fascinating backdrop. Although the Rossoneri previously endured a painful sequence of six consecutive defeats against their cross-town adversaries, they have dramatically turned the tide. Currently, Milan enjoys a seven-match unbeaten run against Inter across all competitions, featuring five victories and two draws. This impressive sequence stands as their most successful stretch in the derby for more than twenty years. Last season, both league encounters concluded identically with narrow one-to-nil triumphs for Milan. Ahead of this crucial battle, the squad receives a timely boost with the recoveries of Mario Gila, Adrien Rabiot, and Diego Moreira, all returning to the available pool. Conversely, the defending champions Inter must cope with the continued absence of Lautaro Martínez. Yet, Inter remains a powerhouse, having amassed twenty-five points from twenty-seven possible and sustaining a remarkable nineteen-match unbeaten streak in domestic league action. Their lineup will also be reinforced by the anticipated returns of Nicolò Barella and Hakan Çalhanoğlu, both of whom rested during a tactical rotation in the recent victory over Venezia.","Meanwhile, elsewhere in the upper echelon of Italian football, third-placed Roma prepares for a challenging away trip to face Udinese. Roma shares an elite distinction with Inter as the only other team remaining undefeated in Serie A this campaign, yet a sense of frustration lingers within their camp. Consecutive away draws against Napoli and Como have left them trailing their fierce city rivals, Lazio, by four points in the table. On a brighter note for the Giallorossi, Donyell Malen is expected to reclaim his spot in the starting formation after making a decisive impact as a substitute and scoring in a four-to-two triumph over Cagliari. In stark contrast, Udinese endures a deeply troubled season, hovering perilously close to the relegation zone with a meager five points accumulated from nine matches. A recent scoreless stalemate away against Parma managed to halt a dismal six-match losing slide, but the team continues to battle formidable obstacles, including a sequence of four consecutive home defeats. Udinese will desperately seek inspiration from their previous meeting against Roma roughly nine months ago, when they secured a narrow one-to-nil home victory against the capital club following six straight losses in that specific matchup."],"facts":[{"fact":"Inter leads the Serie A standings with 25 points from 27 possible, holding a seven-point gap over fifth-place Milan ahead of the upcoming Derby della Madonnina in the 10th round.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Milan is currently on a seven-match unbeaten run across all competitions against Inter, their best derby sequence in over two decades, despite suffering a recent 4:2 home defeat to Bologna.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Inter will be without Lautaro Martínez, while Milan welcomes back Mario Gila, Adrien Rabiot, and Diego Moreira.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Third-placed Roma, which remains undefeated in Serie A this season alongside Inter, will visit Udinese after drawing their last two away matches against Napoli and Como.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Udinese sits precariously near the relegation zone with only five points after nine rounds, following a scoreless draw with Parma that halted a six-match losing streak.","sources":[1]}],"glossary":[{"text":"tenth","lemma":"tenth","pos":"ADJ","he":"עשירי","name":false},{"text":"round","lemma":"round","pos":"NOUN","he":"מחזור","name":false},{"text":"Italian","lemma":"Italian","pos":"ADJ","he":"איטלקי","name":false},{"text":"Serie A","lemma":"Serie A","pos":"NOUN","he":"סרייה A","name":true},{"text":"promises","lemma":"promise","pos":"VERB","he":"מבטיח","name":false},{"text":"electrifying","lemma":"electrifying","pos":"ADJ","he":"מחשמל / מרתק","name":false},{"text":"weekend","lemma":"weekend","pos":"NOUN","he":"סוף שבוע","name":false},{"text":"anchored","lemma":"anchor","pos":"VERB","he":"מעוגן / עומד במוקד","name":false},{"text":"iconic","lemma":"iconic","pos":"ADJ","he":"אייקוני","name":false},{"text":"Milanese","lemma":"Milanese","pos":"ADJ","he":"מילאנזי